00px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>更好的積雪草地</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/m5T5xmUy/images/396d426aef894e916042c4cfe47fa9e8d10b43a0.png\" alt=\"Preview\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>更好的積雪</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://optifine.readthedocs.io/_images/selection1.webp\" alt=\"Preview\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>完全可配置</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/m5T5xmUy/images/04353df9655cb5d933546399bbcb6f36c943292c.png\" alt=\"YACL\" width=\"250px\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/m5T5xmUy/images/6686b481b056b1be7f57c07b0dada389a8e748b2.png\" alt=\"Reese&#x27;s\" width=\"250px\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/m5T5xmUy/images/55435e2054339fa70efb934ede682f4754c086ac.png\" alt=\"Xander&#x27;s\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>可以手動新增<strong>模組化的草方塊</strong>！</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/m5T5xmUy/images/37f7b8d4ad1712710136969e06f78b5458bd6d66.png\" alt=\"More Blocks\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>致謝！</h2>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fardagrass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>ArdaGrass</strong></a></h3>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
